---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Suites With Keith | Better Rooms. Better Trips."
  description="Hotel recommendations from an advisor who has stood in the rooms. 38 hotels toured and stayed across the Cyclades; booking is complimentary."
  preload="/images/personal/gundari-sunset.jpg"
>

<!-- 1 · The claim -->
<header class="hero">
  <img class="hero-img" src="/images/personal/gundari-sunset.jpg" alt="Sunset over the Aegean from a suite terrace at Gundari, Folegandros" width="1800" height="1350" fetchpriority="high" />
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Suites With Keith</p>
    <h1 class="display-xl">Four weeks.<br>Eight islands.<br><em>38 hotels.</em></h1>
    <p class="sub">I checked into the Cyclades so you don&rsquo;t have to guess. Hotel recommendations from the rooms themselves &mdash; and the booking is complimentary.</p>
    <p class="stamp">Cyclades &middot; toured &amp; stayed &middot; 2025</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="#inquire">Tell me where you&rsquo;re going</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost on-shadow" href="/hotels/cosme-paros.html" style="border-color:rgba(242,239,230,.4); color:var(--band-ink);">See the hotels</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- 2 · The evidence -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The evidence</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Counted, dated, on file</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="ledger reveal">
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">38</span><span class="d"><b>Hotels toured and stayed across the Cyclades</b> in four weeks &mdash; Santorini, Mykonos, Paros, Sifnos, Milos, Folegandros and beyond, solo, room by room.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">123</span><span class="d"><b>Hotels on file</b> &mdash; researched, compared and written up, from Aman Kyoto to Er&emacr;ma on Milos. The ones I&rsquo;ve slept in say so, with the date.</span></div>
      <div class="ledger-row"><span class="n">01</span><span class="d"><b>Issue No. 01 of The Greece Collection</b> in print &mdash; the field notes behind every recommendation on this site. Napa &amp; Sonoma lands September 15.</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 3 · The judgment -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">The judgment</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Cosme or Par&imacr;lio?</h2>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:44ch;">Paros&rsquo; two best hotels are ten minutes apart and nothing alike. No hotel will answer this question. I will &mdash; it takes about thirty seconds.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="choose reveal">
      <a class="choose-col" href="/compare/cosme-vs-parilio.html" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Choose Cosme</span>
        <h3>If you want to walk to dinner</h3>
        <p class="lead">A true beach out front, Naousa on foot, and entry rooms bigger than most hotels&rsquo; junior suites. You won&rsquo;t think about a car once.</p>
      </a>
      <a class="choose-col" href="/compare/cosme-vs-parilio.html" style="text-decoration:none;">
        <span class="eyebrow">Choose Par&imacr;lio</span>
        <h3>If you want to be alone</h3>
        <p class="lead">Architecture, quiet, and a private pool you&rsquo;ll actually spend the afternoon in. For most honeymoons, this is the one.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
    <p class="reveal" style="margin-top:26px;"><a href="/compare/cosme-vs-parilio.html" style="font-size:.74rem; font-weight:500; letter-spacing:.14em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--brass); text-decoration:none;">Read the full head-to-head &rarr;</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 4 · The advocacy -->
<section class="section band on-shadow">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Same rate &mdash; sometimes better</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">You can book the room.<br>You can&rsquo;t make them know you.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal" style="display:grid; gap:40px; grid-template-columns:1fr;">
      <p class="story-quote">&ldquo;With less than 24 hours&rsquo; notice we needed a hotel in Saint-Tropez in peak season. Keith stepped in with the perfect recommendation &mdash; and personally contacted the hotel before our arrival. <b>When we pulled up, the staff greeted us by name</b>, welcomed us with cold towels, and surprised us with a complimentary upgrade.&rdquo;</p>
      <div>
        <p class="attr">Tyler &amp; Spencer C. &middot; COMO Le Beauvallon &middot; Saint-Tropez</p>
        <p class="body-2" style="margin-top:20px; max-width:52ch;">The rate through me is the one you&rsquo;d pay booking direct &mdash; sometimes better. What changes is who calls the hotel before you arrive, and who answers while you&rsquo;re there.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 5 · The Collection -->
<section class="section" id="collection">
  <div class="container" style="display:grid; gap:44px; grid-template-columns:1fr; align-items:center;">
    <div class="sec-head reveal" style="margin-bottom:0;">
      <span class="eyebrow">The Greece Collection &middot; Issue No. 01</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">The field notes, in print</h2>
      <p class="deck" style="margin-top:16px; max-width:40ch;">A firsthand journal of the Cyclades &mdash; 38 hotels, seven destination guides, and the research behind every verdict on this site.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:26px;"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/index.html#collection">Read Issue No. 01</a></p>
    </div>
    <figure class="reveal" style="margin:0; max-width:520px;">
      <img src="/images/personal/greece-collection-cover-mockup.jpg" alt="The Greece Collection, Issue No. 01 — printed magazine" width="1200" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(22,23,18,.18);" />
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 6 · The range -->
<section class="section" id="range">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">Beyond Greece</span>
      <h2 class="display-l">Where I plan most often</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="cards four reveal">
      <a class="card" href="#inquire">
        <img src="/images/proposals/maldives-overwater.jpg" alt="Overwater villas in the Maldives" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">Honeymoon</span><h3>The Maldives</h3><p>Three overwater itineraries, compared side by side.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="#inquire">
        <img src="/images/proposals/lake-como-garden.jpg" alt="Gardens meeting the water at Lake Como" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">Lakeside</span><h3>Lake Como</h3><p>Four of the lake&rsquo;s finest hotels, compared.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="#inquire">
        <img src="/images/proposals/paris/crillon-pool.jpg" alt="The pool at Hôtel de Crillon, Paris" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">City &amp; culture</span><h3>Paris</h3><p>Five palace hotels, compared from stays and tours.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="#inquire">
        <img src="/images/napa/madrona.jpg" alt="The Madrona, Sonoma wine country" width="1800" height="1200" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="pad"><span class="kicker">Wine country</span><h3>Napa &amp; Sonoma</h3><p>Nine hotels, ranked from personal stays.</p><span class="go">Explore &rarr;</span></div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- 7 · The ask -->
<section class="section inquire" id="inquire">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow reveal" style="display:block; margin-bottom:16px;">One question</span>
    <h2 class="display-l reveal">Where and when?</h2>
    <p class="deck reveal" style="margin:18px auto 0; max-width:38ch;">&ldquo;Santorini in June&rdquo; is a complete answer. I&rsquo;ll take it from there.</p>
    <form class="inquire-form reveal" action="https://formspree.io/f/mjgnadov" method="POST">
      <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="Inquiry — Phase 1 preview" />
      <input type="hidden" name="page" value="phase1/index" />
      <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="step1">
        <label for="q-when">Where and when?</label>
        <input id="q-when" type="text" name="travel_dates" placeholder="Santorini in June" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="step2">
        <label for="q-name">And where do I send the recommendation?</label>
        <input id="q-name" type="text" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="name" />
        <input id="q-email" type="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required autocomplete="email" />
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="btn">Send</button>
      <p class="note">Traveling within the next 30 days? You&rsquo;ll hear from me today.</p>
      <p class="status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    #collection .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
</style>
